{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Horror with a real life footage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Warning: This game contains some intense jumpscares.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- After looking for a job for a long time, you started as an operator in a</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >company named &quot;Paranormal Inc.&quot; You will watch live CCTV footage and report the anomalies you see.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- A very good blend of reality and paranormal observation duty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- With real life footages this horror game gets even more scarier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Find and report unusual activity in the footages</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Try to avoid sending false reports</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Earn enough xp points to unlock next location</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Very realistic gameplay with real life footage</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Creepy and scary locations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Supports many languages</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Difficulty modes:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Easy: Less anomalies, shorter duty time, requires 60% success rate</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Medium: Moderate anomaly count, average duty time, requires 70% success rate</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Hard: Much more anomalies, full duty time, requires 80% success rate</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Subtitles option for those who can't hear noise/sound anomalies</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3712270?t=1750096285","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712270/e2249442e0c7d162415cb98da01e4d8866bbb802/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1750096285","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712270/5a144bd7d879449bd83a45e5bb06684f0386d846/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750096285","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets